⚡️🇱🇧🇸🇾 protests inside Roumieh Prison following the suspension of the general amnesty law in Lebanon and the death of a Syrian detainee due to cancer.
Roumieh Prison is a prison in lebanon for syrian detainees and most of them were detained because of their relation with the revolution.

